- Fixed uninstall scripts for Fleet-maintained apps on macOS leaving an app's leftover files behind when no one was logged in. At the login window, the app's own files outside users' home folders (for example, `/Users/Shared/GOG.com` or `/Library/Application Support/TeamViewer`) are now deleted, and files inside home folders are skipped. Before, these files were moved into a Trash folder that doesn't exist.
